@Chlo_eat here. You are all loving my curry and rice series, so I’ve brought you another one: crispy sesame tofu curry and rice. If you don’t like tofu, this one may convert you. No frying needed, the tofu crisps in the oven with sesame seeds which transforms the whole dish. Served with a simple coconut curry sauce and herbs to freshen the whole thing up🫶

